{"id":"n50261-1-8","stage":4,"title":"둥그렇다 · 圆圆的","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n50261-1-8-1","ko":"이제 바퀴 만들 차례지?","zh":"现在该做轮子了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"바퀴","meaning":"车轮，轮子，轱辘","explanation":"바퀴：车轮，轮子，轱辘","readings":[{"term":"바퀴","audio":"/audio/c8e16f13560a8ff45d3f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15443","senseId":"1","lemma":"바퀴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바퀴","audio":"/audio/c8e16f13560a8ff45d3f.mp3"}},{"text":"만들","meaning":"制作，做，制造","explanation":"만들다：制作，做，制造；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"만들다","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60317","senseId":"1","lemma":"만들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"만들","audio":"/audio/5ee1d6aec61ef1992584.mp3"}},{"text":"차례지?","meaning":"顺序，次序","explanation":"차례：顺序，次序；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"차례","audio":"/audio/e9fa78157c623c88645e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62410","senseId":"2","lemma":"차례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차례지","audio":"/audio/e012d104d567faae15a2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"当下的时期。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"c8e16f13560a8ff4","term":"바퀴","zh":"车轮，轮子，轱辘","audio":"/audio/c8e16f13560a8ff45d3f.mp3","entryId":"15443","definition":"可以旋转或滚动的圆形物体。","pronunciation":["바퀴"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"e9fa78157c623c88","term":"차례","zh":"顺序，次序","audio":"/audio/e9fa78157c623c88645e.mp3","entryId":"62410","definition":"按照做事情或事情发生的顺序所得到的机会。","pronunciation":["차례"]}],"audio":"/audio/14f26ceeba854748ebbd.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n50261-1-8-2","ko":"응, 종이를 둥그렇게 자르자.","zh":"嗯，把纸剪成圆形吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"종이를","meaning":"纸，纸片","explanation":"종이：纸，纸片；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"종이","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75802","senseId":"1","lemma":"종이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종이를","audio":"/audio/50410222fc193a82c9aa.mp3"}},{"text":"둥그렇게","meaning":"圆圆的","explanation":"둥그렇다：圆圆的；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"둥그렇다","audio":"/audio/cd548a08d28335cbb806.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"50261","senseId":"1","lemma":"둥그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"둥그렇게","audio":"/audio/fbd719c5522e43edb9a8.mp3"}},{"text":"자르자.","meaning":"切断，剪，砍断","explanation":"자르다：切断，剪，砍断；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"자르다","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17787","senseId":"1","lemma":"자르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"자르자","audio":"/audio/0eb491f78132c09657fb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"8879faff5daebd51","term":"종이","zh":"纸，纸片","audio":"/audio/8879faff5daebd510706.mp3","entryId":"75802","definition":"以木材为原料制成薄片，用于写字、绘画、印刷等诸多方面的东西。","pronunciation":["종이"]},{"id":"cd548a08d28335cb","term":"